    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42846" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρώτ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>questioning, interrogation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Steril.</u>
				213
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				312d
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.4.13
			</span></i>, al. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιήσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					8.58
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i>about</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				147c
