			<i>interrogative</i> adverbs, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				642.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀντιφάσεως</span> ('Is A B or is it
