			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				b10
			</span></i> ; 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρώτημα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>proposition, matter submitted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηλοῖ τὴν ἐ. φόβον ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
					1.103
				</span></i>
			.</div>
